  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food Affordability in Conflict-Torn Yemen in Light of the Ukraine War</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will provide vital information and actionable policy recommendations for addressing the food crisis in Yemen. Through a political economy lens, the reasons behind various inefficiencies contributing to the food crisis will be assessed and analyzed, with the aim of identifying practical measures for addressing them.</narrative>
  </description>
